WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.084 --> 00:00:11.396
I unlock your door. What am I?

2
00:00:11.397 --> 00:00:14.153
I am a key.

3
00:00:14.154 --> 00:00:18.735
I light your room. What am I?

4
00:00:18.736 --> 00:00:21.542
I am a lamp.

5
00:00:21.543 --> 00:00:26.363
I clean your room. What am I?

6
00:00:26.364 --> 00:00:30.950
I am a vacuum cleaner.

7
00:00:30.951 --> 00:00:35.211
I keep your food. What am I?

8
00:00:35.212 --> 00:00:38.720
I am a refrigerator.

9
00:00:38.721 --> 00:00:43.256
I make tasty toast. What am I?

10
00:00:43.257 --> 00:00:47.010
I am a toaster.

11
00:00:47.011 --> 00:00:51.795
I bake yummy cookies. What am I?

12
00:00:51.796 --> 00:00:54.957
I am an oven.

13
00:00:54.958 --> 00:00:59.655
I clean your clothes. What am I?

14
00:00:59.656 --> 00:01:05.275
I am a washing machine.

15
00:01:05.276 --> 00:01:10.014
I take pictures. What am I?

16
00:01:10.015 --> 00:01:15.994
I am a camera.
